      "heading": "Suspicious, not definite (B5a)",
      "points": [
       "Irregular nests at the edge or within the capsule, short of definite stromal invasion",
       "Unequivocal in situ carcinoma with features suspicious of invasion is B5a (RCPath G150)",
       "Uncertain invasion on a core: excision to settle it (Rakha 2026), not neoadjuvant therapy (Rakha 2024)"
      ],
      "images": []
     },
     {
      "heading": "Present (B5b)",
      "points": [
       "Absent myoepithelial cells plus unequivocal stromal invasion: irregular infiltrative margins, desmoplasia, or entrapped breast structures (Rakha 2026)",
       "Entrapped fat cells within an encapsulated papillary carcinoma are a definite sign of invasion (Rakha 2024)",
       "Jagged nests in a jigsaw pattern within desmoplastic stroma: invasive solid papillary carcinoma (WHO 6th ed.)",
       "Grade, size and receptors are assessed in the invasive component (Rakha 2024)"
      ],
      "images": [
